<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>ID vs CLASS</title>
    <style>
        /* NEON ANIMATED BACKGROUND */
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI';
            color: #e6edf3;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            margin: 0;
            background: #000;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }
        body::before {
            content: "";
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0;
            width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, #00f5ff 0%, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, #ff00ff 0%, transparent 50%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #00ff88 0%, transparent 50%);
            filter: blur(80px);
            animation: neonMove 15s infinite alternate;
            z-index: -1;
        }
        @keyframes neonMove {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg) scale(1.2); }
        }

        .container { max-width: 900px; margin: auto; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
        h1 { 
            color: #00f5ff; 
            text-align: center; 
            margin-bottom: 40px; 
            font-size: 2.8em;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px #00f5ff, 0 0 20px #00f5ff;
        }

        .section { 
            background: rgba(22, 27, 34, 0.7); 
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            padding: 25px; 
            margin-bottom: 25px; 
            border-radius: 12px; 
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.3);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.1);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .section:hover {
            border-color: #00f5ff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.3);
        }
        .section h2 { color: #00f5ff; margin-bottom: 12px; text-shadow: 0 0 8px #00f5ff; }
        .desc { margin-bottom: 20px; color: #b1bac4; line-height: 1.7; }

        .grid { display: flex; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .code, .result { flex: 1; min-width: 300px; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; }
        .code { background: rgba(1, 4, 9, 0.8); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 245, 255, 0.2); }
        .result { background: rgba(13, 17, 23, 0.8); border: 1px dashed #ff00ff; }
        .code h4, .result h4 { color: #ff00ff; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 14px; }
        pre { color: #00ff88; font-family: Consolas; white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0; }

        /* Output Styling */
        .btn { 
            background: #1f6feb; 
            color: white; 
            padding: 10px 20px; 
            border-radius: 6px; 
            border: none; 
            margin: 5px; 
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px #1f6feb;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        #alert-btn { background: #da3633; box-shadow: 0 0 10px #da3633; }

        .summary { 
            background: rgba(22, 27, 34, 0.7); 
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            padding: 25px; 
            border-radius: 12px; 
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.3);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.1);
        }
        .summary h2 { color: #ff00ff; margin-bottom: 15px; text-shadow: 0 0 8px #ff00ff; }
        .summary table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        .summary td { padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(48, 54, 61, 0.5); }
        .summary td:first-child { color: #00f5ff; width: 120px; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>HTML: ID aur CLASS</h1>

        <!-- CLASS SECTION -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2>CLASS</h2>
            <p class="desc">Ek jaisi styling wale multiple elements ke liye. CSS me <code>.</code> se likhte hain. Kitni bhi baar use kar sakte.</p>
            
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="code">
                    <h4>HTML</h4>
                    <pre>&lt;button class="btn"&gt;Save&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;button class="btn"&gt;Update&lt;/button&gt;</pre>
                    <h4 style="margin-top:15px;">CSS</h4>
                    <pre>.btn {
  background: #1f6feb;
  padding: 10px 20px;
}</pre>
                </div>
                <div class="result">
                    <h4>OUTPUT</h4>
                    <button class="btn">Save</button>
                    <button class="btn">Update</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ID SECTION -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2>ID</h2>
            <p class="desc">Page me sirf 1 unique element ke liye. CSS me <code>#</code> se likhte hain. 1 baar hi use hogi.</p>

            <div class="grid">
                <div class="code">
                    <h4>HTML</h4>
                    <pre>&lt;button id="alert-btn"&gt;Delete&lt;/button&gt;</pre>
                    <h4 style="margin-top:15px;">CSS</h4>
                    <pre>#alert-btn {
  background: #da3633;
  font-weight: bold;
}</pre>
                </div>
                <div class="result">
                    <h4>OUTPUT</h4>
                    <button class="btn" id="alert-btn">Delete</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- SUMMARY SECTION -->
        <div class="summary">
            <h2>Quick Summary</h2>
            <table>
                <tr>
                    <td>CLASS</td>
                    <td><code>.name</code> | Multiple use | Styling ke liye</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>ID</td>
                    <td><code>#name</code> | Single use | JS/Link/Unique ke liye</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Priority</td>
                    <td>ID > CLASS. Dono takraye toh ID jeetegi</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>
</html>
